{{!-- courses/faq-item.hbs — one question, as the design system's
     `.ns-faq__item`.

     A native <details>: it opens with JavaScript off, it is keyboard-operable
     for free, and in-page search can find the answer inside a closed one in
     browsers that support hidden=until-found. The caret is drawn by the
     component, so there is no icon to rotate here.

     Params: q, a --}}
<details class="ns-faq__item">
  <summary>{{q}}</summary>
  <div class="ns-faq__body"><p>{{a}}</p></div>
</details>
